{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2021-03-08 08:06:00', 'title': 'CUMMINS INTRODUCES NEW HEAVY-DUTY POWERTRAIN FOR NATURAL GAS CUSTOMERS', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GLOBAL POWER LEADER CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI) AND CUMMINS WESTPORT INC. ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE ISX12N+ENDURANT HD N POWERTRAIN FROM ITS INTEGRATED POWER PORTFOLIO IS NOW AVAILABLE FOR HEAVY-DUTY CUSTOMERS, DELIVERING A FULLY INTEGRATED NATURAL GAS POWERTRAIN. THE COMBINATION OF THE ISX12N NEAR ZERO NATURAL GAS ENGINE AND THE ENDURANT HD N 12-SPEED AUTOMATED TRANSMISSION FROM EATON CUMMINS AUTOMATED TRANSMISSION TECHNOLOGIES IS WELL SUITED FOR HEAVY-DUTY REGIONA'}